      "label": "PROHIBITION",
      "source": "§ 3 / HAVA § 303A(a)(1)(A)",
      "text": "the appropriate State or local election official may not provide a ballot for an election for Federal office to an individual who desires to vote in person unless the individual presents to the official a valid physical photo identification",
